Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.17,0:00:29.85,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU! YAMU! YAMU! YAMU! YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.01,0:00:31.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Your move!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.31,0:01:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,The power of our Egyptian god monsters\Nis equal. But neither one will
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.03,0:01:14.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Give up this fight. You're right. It\Nmust be a holographic malfunction.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.49,0:01:19.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.11,0:01:23.55,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the ultimate power\Nstruggle. These two
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.63,0:01:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,egyptian gods have been\Npushed to their limits
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.43,0:01:30.67,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.89,0:01:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,That light is stronger than\Nanything my machinery can produce
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.39,0:01:47.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, this is nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.97,0:01:52.03,Default,,0,0,0,,man That light is intense What do\Nyou think's going on out there, guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.11,0:01:55.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Who knows, but whatever\Nit is, it's not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.69,0:02:04.49,Default,,0,0,0,,My Millennium Rod is activating.\NIts powers are beyond my
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.57,0:02:08.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Control! This is exactly what\Nhappened during Kaiba's last duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.43,0:02:11.57,Default,,0,0,0,,The light!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.85,0:02:12.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.07,0:02:28.11,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up with my Millennium Puzzle?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.19,0:02:32.15,Default,,0,0,0,,The struggle between Obelisk and Slifer\Nmust have sparked something inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.23,0:02:33.93,Default,,0,0,0,,But where is it taking us?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.61,0:02:40.65,Default,,0,0,0,,This can't be real.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.05,0:02:50.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like some sort of ancient city.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.01,0:02:53.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It's completely destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.99,0:02:59.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Something about this place\Nseems really familiar to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.19,0:03:00.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure why.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.45,0:03:05.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, Yugi, this looks like Egypt.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.61,0:03:07.55,Default,,0,0,0,,But that doesn't make any sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.77,0:03:09.35,Default,,0,0,0,,We're on my Duel Tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.13,0:03:14.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba, we've been\Ntransported to another place.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.93,0:03:16.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps another time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.01,0:03:17.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.69,0:03:22.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe this is just a vision\Ncreated by my puzzle.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.21,0:03:25.21,Default,,0,0,0,,But then how can Kaiba see it too?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.69,0:03:27.69,Default,,0,0,0,,He doesn't have a Millennium Item.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.89,0:03:38.79,Default,,0,0,0,,That looks like Obelisk the\NTormentor and Slifer the Sky Dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.43,0:03:42.19,Default,,0,0,0,,But they're made of stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.83,0:03:44.15,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.63,0:03:50.51,Default,,0,0,0,,These are statues of the Egyptian gods.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.07,0:03:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.93,0:03:54.79,Default,,0,0,0,,The detail is incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.87,0:03:58.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks exactly like Slifer an obelisk.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.17,0:04:01.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe that's because it is them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.25,0:04:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,But how were they turned to stone?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.93,0:04:09.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at this dump.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.71,0:04:12.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm guessing that no\None's lived here for ages.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.45,0:04:15.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, and the entire city is\Nshrouded in a dark cloud.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.13,0:04:25.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, Kaiba!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.61,0:04:28.49,Default,,0,0,0,,The darkness seems to be\Ncoming from that palace!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.09,0:04:31.07,Default,,0,0,0,,But what lies within?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.67,0:04:41.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at the almighty Pharaoh now!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.19,0:04:45.09,Default,,0,0,0,,It appears your once prosperous\Nkingdom has crumbled under.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.17,0:04:48.83,Default,,0,0,0,,your feet and is now in the\Nmerciless grip of the Dark One.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.35,0:04:52.65,Default,,0,0,0,,How does it feel to be\Nvirtually powerless?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.85,0:04:57.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba, these are the two ancient\Nfigures we saw on the stone carving.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.25,0:04:59.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.07,0:05:04.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, Kaiba, it's my puzzle.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.79,0:05:07.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Why have you chosen his side over mine?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.97,0:05:09.85,Default,,0,0,0,,That's where you're wrong, my pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.93,0:05:13.71,Default,,0,0,0,,My minions and I have no\Nallegiance to the Dark One.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.97,0:05:16.37,Default,,0,0,0,,But we have no allegiance to you either.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.95,0:05:22.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I am here to finish our battle and prove\Nno one can overpower my Millennium Rod.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.41,0:05:23.61,Default,,0,0,0,,The Millennium Rod?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.17,0:05:27.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Even in my darkest hour,\NI shall defeat you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.75,0:05:30.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let our duel begin, Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.51,0:05:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,,The moment I've been waiting for is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.97,0:05:37.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I will finally take you down. Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.47,0:05:42.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I shall be forever remembered\Nas he who defeated the Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.91,0:05:47.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Now prepare yourself, for it's\Ntime to meet my ultimate beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.17,0:05:50.55,Default,,0,0,0,,It will show you no mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.07,0:05:52.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.03,0:05:56.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Behold, my dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.65,0:06:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Blue-Eyes White Dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.49,0:06:06.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you shall meet my loyal\Nservant. Show yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.37,0:06:14.03,Default,,0,0,0,,that's the dark magician this is\Nthe ancient conflict that a shizu
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.11,0:06:19.63,Default,,0,0,0,,spoke of and according to a shizu\Nthese are ancient versions of ourselves
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.97,0:06:25.07,Default,,0,0,0,,this whole thing must be one of\Nmarrick's hocus pocus mind tricks
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.01,0:06:29.85,Default,,0,0,0,,i'm afraid you don't stand a chance
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.01,0:06:39.21,Default,,0,0,0,,it's the ancient tablet\NNow I know this isn't real.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.49,0:06:41.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba and I were destined to battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.01,0:06:43.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I've seen enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.21,0:06:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Who invoked the power\Nof my Millennium Rod?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.51,0:07:02.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.85,0:07:05.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that light is getting dimmer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.29,0:07:06.17,Default,,0,0,0,,But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.25,0:07:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba, are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.85,0:07:11.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.81,0:07:18.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What just happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.43,0:07:25.11,Default,,0,0,0,,We were shown the origins of our destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.43,0:07:27.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Seto!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.41,0:07:31.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to the Egyptian god cards?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.51,0:07:40.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Now do you believe in your connection\Nto the past? What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.59,0:07:45.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Here I fear that Kaiba's past\Nintersects with that of the Millennium.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.83,0:07:49.01,Default,,0,0,0,,rod but he'll never get his hands
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.09,0:07:52.97,Default,,0,0,0,,on my birthright i know who i am
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.05,0:07:57.65,Default,,0,0,0,,i'm seto kaiba president of the\Nworld's largest gaming corporation
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.85,0:08:02.49,Default,,0,0,0,,But I can't seem to get those\Nimages out of my head. It
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.57,0:08:05.79,Default,,0,0,0,,seems that no matter what I\Ndo This ancient fairy tale
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.87,0:08:09.25,Default,,0,0,0,,keeps coming back to haunt\Nme It all started when
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.33,0:08:13.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Ishizu tried to brainwash me\Nwith her lies in the museum.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.73,0:08:14.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Ever since then,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.13,0:08:20.13,Default,,0,0,0,,My mind's been playing tricks on me.\NIt happened during my duel with Ishizu.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.89,0:08:25.51,Default,,0,0,0,,And again when I was able to read the\Nancient text on the winged dragon of Ra
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.61,0:08:29.59,Default,,0,0,0,,But today's visions\Nwere the most intense so
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.67,0:08:33.05,Default,,0,0,0,,far I felt as though\Nmy body was transported
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.13,0:08:36.19,Default,,0,0,0,,to another place in time\NBut that doesn't make
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.27,0:08:39.77,Default,,0,0,0,,any sense I will not\Nlose my grip on reality
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.47,0:08:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you understand the\Nsignificance of this duel?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.09,0:08:47.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand that I need to win, Yugi
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.73,0:08:51.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't deny what we both saw
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.45,0:08:56.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, don't be a fool That was\Nnothing more than an illusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.95,0:09:01.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba, acknowledge the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.25,0:09:02.19,Default,,0,0,0,,This is fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.51,0:09:07.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You and I have been destined to duel\Neach other for 5,000 years. Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.17,0:09:09.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's just end this now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.79,0:09:18.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm dueling for so much more\Nthan a mere tournament victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.21,0:09:20.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that clear?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.85,0:09:25.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I joined this to help save mankind,\Nand nothing will stand in my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.03,0:09:28.23,Default,,0,0,0,,That includes you, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.19,0:09:32.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Believe whatever you want, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.49,0:09:34.11,Default,,0,0,0,,This will all be over soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.13,0:09:37.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, everything will soon be over.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.19,0:09:41.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I just need to ensure that\NKaiba's link to my plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.63,0:09:45.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Millennium Rod doesn't\Ninterfere with my plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.51,0:09:49.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I must win this tournament in\Norder to gain infinite power.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.73,0:09:52.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Last I checked, it was\Nstill your move, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.23,0:09:55.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you're starting to make some sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.75,0:10:00.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's move on so I can end this\Nand claim the victory I deserve.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.39,0:10:03.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you're ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.41,0:10:08.31,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, I'll place one\Ncard face down on the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.51,0:10:13.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't need an Egyptian\Ngod card to defeat you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.73,0:10:17.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a more reliable\Ncard in my hand now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.39,0:10:18.95,Default,,0,0,0,,My blue eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.03,0:10:21.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my move now!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.97,0:10:24.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no! Not Gazelle!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.47,0:10:27.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't wipe out Kaiba's\Nlife points with this!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.23,0:10:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too weak!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.43,0:10:30.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha ha ha ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.81,0:10:34.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba has no monsters on the\Nfield to protect himself!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.99,0:10:38.45,Default,,0,0,0,,His life points are wide open\Nfor the Pharaoh to attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.23,0:10:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.39,0:10:45.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I summon Gazelle, the King of\NMythical Beasts, in defense mode!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.01,0:10:53.71,Default,,0,0,0,,If that's all you've got, you're done!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.45,0:10:55.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Behold my trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.41,0:11:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.32,0:11:01.93,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's... Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.19,0:11:06.93,Default,,0,0,0,,my cloning trap card has made an exact\Nduplicate of your King of Mythical Beasts,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.01,0:11:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.33,0:11:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.24,0:11:10.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like we're tied again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.25,0:11:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I shall place one card face down now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.39,0:11:15.77,Default,,0,0,0,,That ends my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.71,0:11:20.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Yugi, but you've\Njust made your final move.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.03,0:11:27.23,Default,,0,0,0,,For the monster that I now hold in my\Nhand is the key to your ultimate demise.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.23,0:11:32.11,Default,,0,0,0,,All I need to do is sacrifice\Nthe gazelle I got from you,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.25,0:11:34.23,Default,,0,0,0,,and I can summon it to the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.59,0:11:39.51,Default,,0,0,0,,So prepare to feel the wrath\Nof my blue-eyes white dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.11,0:11:41.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Blue-eyes? But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.29,0:11:45.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You need to sacrifice\Ntwo monsters for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.09,0:11:46.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.83,0:11:50.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You should know that things\Naren't always what they seem!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.21,0:11:51.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough talk, Kaiba!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.61,0:11:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Just make your move so\Nwe can end this duel!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.75,0:11:58.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, ending this duel is\Nexactly what I'm about to do!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.57,0:12:00.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to this magic card!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.55,0:12:05.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, you were correct!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.55,0:12:08.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Summoning Blue Eyes usually\Nrequires two sacrifices!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.67,0:12:14.81,Default,,0,0,0,,However, thanks to my magic card,\Nthat rule no longer holds true now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.17,0:12:19.73,Default,,0,0,0,,This card is the key to unlocking\Nmy great beast and wiping you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.99,0:12:22.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Behold, my cost-down magic card.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.37,0:12:26.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Now my blue-eyes white\Ndragon is instantly reduced
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.85,0:12:30.23,Default,,0,0,0,,from an eight-star monster\Nto a six-star monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.55,0:12:32.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.63,0:12:36.31,Default,,0,0,0,,That means Kaiba only needs to\Nsacrifice one monster to summon it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.39,0:12:38.17,Default,,0,0,0,,The time has come!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.51,0:12:42.35,Default,,0,0,0,,And mark my words, this\Nis no illusion, you fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.25,0:12:46.07,Default,,0,0,0,,First I sacrifice my gazelle clone!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.23,0:12:50.63,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, I summon Blue-Eyes White Dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.87,0:12:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.99,0:12:56.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Take it to the hoop, Seto!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.17,0:12:58.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing can stop you now!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.05,0:13:05.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, perhaps I'll be facing\NKaiba in the next round after all!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.09,0:13:11.63,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, it's time for me to finally\Nput an end to this feud right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.17,0:13:15.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Blue Eyes, attack his\Ngazelle with white lightning!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.47,0:13:22.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha ha ha ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.31,0:13:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You may as well throw in the towel, Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.99,0:13:27.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Your only monster's gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.19,0:13:33.79,Default,,0,0,0,,And unless you can summon something with\Nover 3,000 attack points, this duel's over!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.35,0:13:42.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I've only got one chance to defeat\NKaiba's Blue-Eyes White Dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.55,0:13:43.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a long shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.05,0:13:48.53,Default,,0,0,0,,If the images of the past we saw are\Ntrue, and history is repeating itself,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.99,0:13:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,then in order to take down Kaiba's\NBlue-Eyes, I have to summon my Dark Magician!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.89,0:13:56.87,Default,,0,0,0,,And this is my last chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.15,0:14:02.23,Default,,0,0,0,,If I don't draw the card I need now, Kaiba\Nwins the duel and I'm out of the finals!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.05,0:14:04.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand back, Kaiba!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.39,0:14:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Behold the truth. I know\Nyou saw the same visions.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.83,0:14:13.95,Default,,0,0,0,,that i did and i'm about to prove it kaiba
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.03,0:14:17.41,Default,,0,0,0,,that's right you and i\Nbattled each other five
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.49,0:14:21.03,Default,,0,0,0,,thousand years ago and\Nnow destiny has brought
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.11,0:14:25.45,Default,,0,0,0,,us together once again\Nit's true look i use
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.53,0:14:28.43,Default,,0,0,0,,monster reborn to bring\Nback a monster from my
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.51,0:14:31.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Graveyard, the servant\Nof the ancient pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.51,0:14:36.85,Default,,0,0,0,,The Dark Magician. Now,\NDark Magician, come forth!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.75,0:14:42.95,Default,,0,0,0,,when i played my life\Nshaver trap i forced yugi
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.03,0:14:45.89,Default,,0,0,0,,to discard two cards one\Nof them must have been
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.97,0:14:48.67,Default,,0,0,0,,his dark magician and\Nnow that he's brought it
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.75,0:14:51.75,Default,,0,0,0,,back he expects me to\Nbelieve this ancient egyptian
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.31,0:15:02.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Fairy tale. Your move doesn't\Nprove a thing. Kaiba, how can you
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.99,0:15:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,continue to deny your ancient\Npast just look at the field blue
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.91,0:15:12.01,Default,,0,0,0,,eyes white dragon faces the\Ndark magician the time has come
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.09,0:15:16.87,Default,,0,0,0,,to accept your destiny Kaiba\Nfate has led us to battle again!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.47,0:15:25.01,Default,,0,0,0,,There's so much about this ancient\Nfeud that's still a mystery.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.09,0:15:27.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Like, what were we fighting\Nover in the first place?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.57,0:15:29.07,Default,,0,0,0,,And who eventually won?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.83,0:15:35.93,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time for Yugi to learn the hard way\Nthat real duelists make their own destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.97,0:15:37.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Now then,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.65,0:15:41.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall place one card face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.13,0:15:44.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope this works, because if it doesn't,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.05,0:15:48.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba's monster will crush\Nmine. His blue eyes has
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.47,0:15:52.81,Default,,0,0,0,,3 000 points and my dark\Nmagician only has 2500 that
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.89,0:15:55.93,Default,,0,0,0,,means one attack by kaiba\Nand my magician's a goner
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.01,0:15:59.19,Default,,0,0,0,,so it's all up to my face\Ndown cards to save me
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.85,0:16:02.87,Default,,0,0,0,,luckily i have a magic\Nformula card which can raise
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.95,0:16:06.45,Default,,0,0,0,,My Dark Magician's attack\Npoints by 500, then it'll be
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.53,0:16:09.71,Default,,0,0,0,,equal in strength to kaiba's\Nblue eyes so my monster
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.79,0:16:14.05,Default,,0,0,0,,would also be destroyed i guess\Nit's all up to destiny now
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.43,0:16:17.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.23,0:16:19.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You disappoint me, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.23,0:16:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You're willing to put all your\Nfaith in some old folk story.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.99,0:16:24.97,Default,,0,0,0,,How pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.41,0:16:27.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Who knew you'd take it this far?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.91,0:16:30.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone shows you some\Nchicken scratch on an
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.53,0:16:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,old rock and you use it\Nto dictate your life?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.29,0:16:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I expected more from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.97,0:16:39.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Trust me, you're no pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.65,0:16:42.81,Default,,0,0,0,,So stop playing make-believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.25,0:16:45.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You're caught up in the\Npast when you should
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.59,0:16:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,be concentrating on what's\Nhappening right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.51,0:16:51.43,Default,,0,0,0,,And that will be your\Ndownfall. We shall see.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.77,0:16:54.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, as soon as you're\Nknocked out of the tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.65,0:16:59.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll move ahead to the final round\Nand reclaim my number one dueling status.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.07,0:17:01.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, let's move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.95,0:17:04.29,Default,,0,0,0,,First, I'll place one card face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.65,0:17:07.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll activate my card of Demise.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.03,0:17:12.09,Default,,0,0,0,,This magic card allows me to draw\Nuntil I'm holding five cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.17,0:17:16.59,Default,,0,0,0,,as long as I discard my entire\Nhand after five turns have passed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.83,0:17:18.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that all you've got?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.33,0:17:23.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I've observed Yugi's past duels very\Ncarefully, and I know what he's up to.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.17,0:17:27.57,Default,,0,0,0,,One of his face-down cards will\Nmake his Dark Magician stronger,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.65,0:17:31.17,Default,,0,0,0,,and he'll use the other one\Nto stop my Blue Eyes attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.05,0:17:32.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Yugi,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.23,0:17:36.29,Default,,0,0,0,,but this little strategy of\Nyours is no secret to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.37,0:17:38.79,Default,,0,0,0,,so I'm afraid it's not going to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.87,0:17:43.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You're planning to take me down\Nwith your two face-down cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.57,0:17:44.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, guess what?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.21,0:17:46.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got a plan, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.25,0:17:48.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Behold this!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.63,0:17:51.87,Default,,0,0,0,,A monster that will\Nseal your fate! Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.15,0:17:54.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I summon Lord of Dragons!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.27,0:18:00.69,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as it's on the field, my Blue Eyes\Nis safe from all magic and trap cards!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.93,0:18:02.43,Default,,0,0,0,,That may be so, Kaiba,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.67,0:18:06.43,Default,,0,0,0,,but my Dark Magician is more\Npowerful than your Lord of Dragons!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.51,0:18:09.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Then go ahead and attack it, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.01,0:18:15.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba may have a plan to stop my attack,\Nbut in order to win, I'll have to try.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.41,0:18:17.07,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, my move.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.39,0:18:21.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I summon Beta, the Magnet\NWarrior, in defense mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.25,0:18:25.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.03,0:18:28.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack me with your Dark Magician.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.51,0:18:33.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Dark Magician, attack\Nhis Lord of Dragons now!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.51,0:18:37.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Too bad, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.39,0:18:40.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I reveal my trap card.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.77,0:18:43.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Magical trick mirror.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.79,0:18:49.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I can take one magic card from your\Ngraveyard and use it as my own for one turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.31,0:18:55.03,Default,,0,0,0,,And I know exactly which one of your\Nold cards I need to get my hands on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.71,0:18:56.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Monster reborn.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.63,0:18:58.71,Default,,0,0,0,,And why's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.85,0:19:03.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I can bring back an old friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.87,0:19:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Behold!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.83,0:19:07.79,Default,,0,0,0,,The rebirth of my Egyptian God card!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.55,0:19:09.91,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Obelisk!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.13,0:19:11.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Very observant, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.13,0:19:15.83,Default,,0,0,0,,But Egyptian God cards can\Nonly be revived for one turn!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.13,0:19:21.55,Default,,0,0,0,,True, but one turn is all I need to block\Nyour Dark Magician's attack! Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.77,0:19:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Too late!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.91,0:19:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time for Obelisk\Nto absorb your attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.83,0:19:30.01,Default,,0,0,0,,This can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.09,0:19:33.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Say goodbye to 1,500 life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.75,0:19:40.93,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks to me like you're out of options.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.57,0:19:43.85,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over.
